/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 40 0 R
/T (Prompting is the process of providing instructions, context, examples, or constraints to an artificial intelligence model to guide its response. In AI agents, prompts play an important role in determining how the agent interprets a task, selects actions, uses available tools, and produces the final output.Different prompt types provide different levels of guidance. Simple prompts may be sufficient for basic tasks, whereas complex tasks may require detailed instructions, multiple examples, self-evaluation, or tool- assisted reasoning. Therefore, selecting an appropriate prompt type helps improve the accuracy, consistency, clarity, and reliability of AI-generated responses. )
/E (Prompting is the process of providing instructions, context, examples, or constraints to an artificial intelligence model to guide its response. In AI agents, prompts play an important role in determining how the agent interprets a task, selects actions, uses available tools, and produces the final output.Different prompt types provide different levels of guidance. Simple prompts may be sufficient for basic tasks, whereas complex tasks may require detailed instructions, multiple examples, self-evaluation, or tool- assisted reasoning. Therefore, selecting an appropriate prompt type helps improve the accuracy, consistency, clarity, and reliability of AI-generated responses. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
