/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 44 0 R
/T (Thus,different prompt types were designed and evaluated to understand their influence on AI agent reasoning, autonomy, and output quality. The sample evaluation showed that zero-shot prompting is suitable for simple tasks, while few-shot and role- based prompting provide additional guidance and context. Instruction-based prompting offers effective control over output requirements, whereas chain-of-thought, self- reflection, ReAct, and tree-of-thought prompting support more structured problem- solving, review, tool interaction, and exploration of alternatives. )
/E (Thus,different prompt types were designed and evaluated to understand their influence on AI agent reasoning, autonomy, and output quality. The sample evaluation showed that zero-shot prompting is suitable for simple tasks, while few-shot and role- based prompting provide additional guidance and context. Instruction-based prompting offers effective control over output requirements, whereas chain-of-thought, self- reflection, ReAct, and tree-of-thought prompting support more structured problem- solving, review, tool interaction, and exploration of alternatives. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
