/Title (Themain objective of this experiment is to understand how different prompting techniques influence the performance of AI agents. The experiment examines how the structure, clarity, and complexity of a prompt affect an agent's ability to understand instructions, solve problems, make decisions, use tools, and generate accurate and meaningful responses.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 231 0 R
/Next 267 0 R
>>
