/Title (Zero-shot prompting received comparatively lower scores because it provides only the task instruction without examples or additional guidance. Few-shot prompting showed improved output quality because examples help establish the expected response pattern. Role-based prompting improved reasoning and output quality by providing a specific context for the task.)
